### PayVerse — bill-payment-service through the gateway (all billers are MOCK).
### MockBillerAdapter: accounts ending in 0000 don't exist; amounts ending in .13 are declined (refunded);
### amounts ending in .14 time out once (the payment stays PENDING and the recovery job finishes it).

### Billers by category (MOBILE, ELECTRICITY, DTH, FASTAG, CREDIT_CARD)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/billers?category=ELECTRICITY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Fetch the current electricity bill
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bills/fetch
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billerCode": "CITY_POWER", "accountRef": "1234567890" }

> {% client.global.set("billAmount", response.body.amountDue.amount); %}

### Pay it (201 SUCCESS/FAILED, 202 PENDING, 200 replay)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bills/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billerCode": "CITY_POWER", "accountRef": "1234567890", "amount": {{billAmount}} }

### Mobile recharge (no bill to fetch)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bills/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billerCode": "VOLTEL_PREPAID", "accountRef": "9876543210", "amount": 299 }

### A declined recharge (.13): debited, then refunded — status FAILED, refunded true
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bills/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billerCode": "VOLTEL_PREPAID", "accountRef": "9876543210", "amount": 199.13 }

### Bill history
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/bills/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Auto-pay the electricity bill monthly, up to INR 3,000 (the PIN is the consent)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/mandates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billerCode": "CITY_POWER", "accountRef": "1234567890", "frequency": "MONTHLY", "maxAmount": 3000 }

> {% client.global.set("mandateId", response.body.id); %}

### Auto-recharge FASTag weekly with INR 500
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/mandates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billerCode": "HIGHWAY_TAG", "accountRef": "KA01AB1234", "frequency": "WEEKLY", "maxAmount": 500, "amount": 500 }

### My mandates
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/mandates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Runs of a mandate (the scheduler checks every minute)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/mandates/{{mandateId}}/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel it
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/mandates/{{mandateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
